 of a family.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official Youtube channel)", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102236, "title": {"romaji": "Shen Po", "english": "Zinba"}, "format": "TV", "description": "The juvenile Kan from the earth is summoned to the Kingdom of Toria , where he encounters attack from the giant creature Zinba, and he's rescued by the linker Shibuki and Uranus. Later, he accidentally gets on the linker squad DUX truck to the maze valley, finding in a cave a golden Zinba.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Lookus English YT Channel, edited)", "startDate": {"year": 2013, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 52, "duration": 22, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Isekai", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102302, "title": {"romaji": "Rakugaki Picasso", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the song \"Rakugaki Picasso\" by 40mP. Collaboration with Pentel Inc.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Vocal Synth", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Drawing", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102337, "title": {"romaji": "Hacka Doll", "english": "Hacka Doll"}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "In the year 2xxx, development of information are going so fast, humans being are drowning in the sea information. This leads to a situation where people can not fi