 who are loyal to the legendary Black Dragon. But the Black Dragon begins to stir from its hibernation, sending the Beasts marching across Altera. With a beast conquest perilously close, a small group of Humans and Elves unite to try to find a secret hidden road to the Black Dragon's cave and destroy it. But the fate of all of them may be in the hands of the young warrior Lambert, who must summon the confidence and skill to face the Black Dragon himself just when all may be lost.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official site)", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 7}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 87, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Elf", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dragons", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Archery", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Fairy Tale", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Magic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Swordplay", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Travel", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102660, "title": {"romaji": "POKER", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "A music video for Shugo Tokumaru animated by Mirai Mizue and Yukie Nakauchi.\n<br>\nThe baby bird flies around the world to transform.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 102681, "title": {"romaji": "Tuzki: LOVE ASSASSIN", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A darkly cute tale of foiled romance and contract assassinations starring Tuzki (兔斯基).<br>\n<br>\n(Source: AniDB)", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Romance"], "tags": []}, {"id": 102687, "title": {"romaji": "Yodomi no Sakagi", "english": "Crazy little Thing"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The two of them, all alone at home. All alone with her father's corpse. Memories, ideals, and reality all sink beneath the muck. Everyone is alone. Everyone is in solitude.\n<br><br>\nGraduate Work 2014, Tokyo University of the Arts, Graduate School of Film and New Media, Department of Animation.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 11, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama", "Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Family Life", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102713, "title": {"romaji": "Xiao Yeyou", "english": "Little Yeyos"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Little Yeyos are seven little spirits living in the mythological Chinese spirit world who wander about only at night. The little intern is always the one who gets ignored and taunted, including today, when he gets kicked out of bed by the female Yeyo to turn off the alarm clock. But the discovery of a mysterious dot of light changes things...if only for a little while. <br><br> (Source: Official Youtube page)", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 3}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102716, "title": {"romaji": "Naze Nani!? Witch Craft Works", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "descriptio